.\n\nShio (the pink-haired girl):\nShe is a quiet, distant girl. She has suffered from  domestic violence, so she often has many injuries on her body. Shio is distrustful of others, and due to her pride, she no longer talks to Yuki.\n\nKeywords for their relationship:\nSchool settings (classroom, nurse’s office)\nAngels, a religious atmosphere\nOutdoor scenes (fields, nighttime)\n\nIf the amount isn’t enough, please adjust it as needed. Composition, poses, and outfits are all up to your creativity. Thank you so much for reading, and I appreciate it whether you accept or not! ♡\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1AR7ebdr-u08J2jhXlxb93DF3K5z0MopI", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ool_x4/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/61a82278/uploads/origins/198c8171-0d33-48bd-987b-5b5fd9ccf844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c378d389dacb1ce9d31bbaf78d84c9b2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61a82278/uploads/origins/198c8171-0d33-48bd-987b-5b5fd9ccf844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c378d389dacb1ce9d31bbaf78d84c9b2, https://si.imgix.net/61a82278/uploads/origins/198c8171-0d33-48bd-987b-5b5fd9ccf844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7d3ce88fdcc9ae54f299639e45c23062 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61a82278/uploads/origins/198c8171-0d33-48bd-987b-5b5fd9ccf844?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d71f322898e0fb6657e5c3d00f3421c6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": "